      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[&hellip; two minas &hellip;]</li>\n<li>For the oil (?): 310 dinars.</li>\n<li>Total: 422 dinars less a sixth.</li>\n<li>Remainder owed to him: 53 dinars less a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d.</li>\n<li>Farh\u0101s: 5 less a sixth. Idr\u012bs: 2 dinars.</li>\n<li>Remainder owed to him: 51 [dinars] less a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d.</li>\n<li>Received in Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d: 14 dinars and a half; remainder of expenses: &frac12; and \u215b dinar less a \u1e25abba.</li>\n<li>Remainder owed to him: 37 dinars less a sixth less a \u1e25abba.</li>\n<li>He has to his credit in Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d a purse of dinars (\u1e63urra); and he has to his credit an order of payment (ruq\u02bfa): 3 [dinars] and a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d,</li>\n<li>and he has to his credit from the purse: 1 dinar and a half and a third and a \u1e25abba; total: 15 dinars less a q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d and a \u1e25abba.</li>\n<li>Owed by him to D\u0101r al-Katt\u0101n for 5 bales: 10 d\u0101niqs and an eighth.</li>\n<li>And owed by him to D\u0101r M\u0101nak for 3 barqal\u016b [items],</li>\n<li>Rash\u012bd and al-Mukht\u0101ra: 2 dinars and &frac12; q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d.</li>\n<li>To the clerks (\u1e63iby\u0101n) of al-Mukht\u0101ra: 3 and a half, and waraq;</li>\n<li>gratuity: 6 dirhams.</li>\n<li>Boat hire to Rash\u012bd: &frac34; dinar less a \u1e25abba.</li>\n<li>Carrying and a dispatch letter and a &frac14; q\u012br\u0101\u1e6d &mdash; and for them also: 2 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds</li>\n<li>and a \u1e25abba; and binding and delivery: 20 dirhams.</li>\n<li>Boat hire at B\u016b\u1e63\u012br for the 5th [batch]: two-thirds less a d\u0101niq.</li>\n<li>Total gold: 17&frac12; and an eighth.</li>\n<li>Waraq: [&hellip; and a half], which in gold: 20 q\u012br\u0101\u1e6ds and a \u1e25abba.</li>\n<li>Total gold and waraq: 14 dinars and a third and an eighth and a \u1e25abba.</li>\n<li>Remainder owed to him: a third and an eighth.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
